 it down for you","65":"I have one important question: ","62":"Sync fitness data through their respective apps.","63":"Generally have fewer iPhone-specific messaging and app capabilities than Apple Watch."}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"Absolutely. Since you're using an iPhone, I'd look at **Garmin, COROS, and Amazfit** rather than another Apple Watch.\n\nThere are several watches that can last **2\u20135 weeks on a single charge**, and some solar-powered models can last virtually indefinitely under ideal sunlight conditions.\n\nHere are my top recommendations.\n\n## Best watches for multi-week battery life\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn530443product2\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Best overall recommendation)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn530443product28\",\"Garmin Instinct 3 Solar\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$349.99\n\n- Unlimited smartwatch battery with sufficient solar exposure (Garmin's specified conditions).\n- Rugged, lightweight design.\n- Heart rate, sleep, fitness and GPS tracking.\n- iPhone notifications.\n\n45 mm version \u00b7 Garmin\n\n\ue200url\ue202Garmin official store\ue202https://www.garmin.com/en-US/p/1315317/pn/010-02934-00/\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn530443product6\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Longest battery life)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn530443product29\",\"Garmin Enduro 3\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$799.99\n\n- Up to 36 days normally.\n- Up to 90 days with sufficient solar exposure.\n- Excellent GPS and outdoor tracking.\n- Premium materials and rugged construction.\n\n51 mm \u00b7 Garmin\n\n\ue200url\ue202Garmin official store\ue202https://www.garmin.com/en-US/p/851039/pn/010-02751-00/\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn530443product0\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn530443product0\",\"COROS VERTIX 2S\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$699\n\n- Up to 36 days of regular use.\n- Up to 118 hours of GPS tracking.\n- Excellent for hiking, running and outdoor activities.\n- Works with iPhone through the COROS app.\n\nCOROS official store\n\n\ue200url\ue202Buy from COROS\ue202https://shop.coros.com/products/coros-vertix-2s-gps-adventure-watch\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn530443product7\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Best budget option)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn530443product7\",\"Amazfit T-Rex 3\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$279.99\n\n- Up to 27 days of battery life.\n- Bright AMOLED screen.\n- GPS and fitness tracking.\n- iPhone compatibility.\n\nAmazfit \u00b7 Available at Target\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at Target\ue202https://www.target.com/p/amazfit-t-rex-3-smartwatch/-/A-94307320\ue201\n\nBattery figures above are manufacturer-rated estimates, not guaranteed real-world results. GPS, screen settings and health monitoring can reduce battery life. \ue200cite\ue202turn530443search3\ue202turn530443search10\ue202turn530443search0\ue202turn530443search1\ue201\n\n## One important thing about using an iPhone\n\nThese watches work with iPhones, but they aren't full replacements for Apple Watch.\n\n- Receive iPhone notifications.\n- Track sleep, heart rate and exercise.\n- Sync fitness data through their respective apps.\n- Generally have fewer iPhone-specific messaging and app capabilities than Apple Watch.\n\n## Let me narrow it down for you\n\nI have one important question: **What do you primarily want from your watch?**"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics","o":"add","v":[{"code":"unterminated_tag","action":"recovered_parse","line":92,"column":1}]}]}     

